Hi {{{Case.First_Name__c}}},
<p>Thank you for reaching out to the Qantas Customer Care team.<br />
<br />
We always want your journey to be as simple and seamless as possible, so I’m sorry to hear about your experience on departure from {{{Case.Departure_Airport__c}}} and the<em><strong> &lt;confiscation of/damage to&gt;</strong></em> of your <em><strong>&lt;Lost Property Name&gt;</strong></em>.<br />
<br />
